 "text": "Hi, how are you holding up these days? Try a quiet room, with someone else sleeping, or busy with noise cancelling. If not, get earplugs and see how it feels. Then use the kitchen sink bathroom instead. Or an office. noise of busy living rooms can mirror you. Then ask neighbor if you can use their bathroom. Or stay overnight if it's still evening. A quiet bedroom is worth doing something for. Good plan. If it' still echoing, ask again. Echoes like this take several tries to tame.",
